rule ComparableBasis
	lineageTag: d350cced-faad-56cb-847f-2bb35ba9f4c3
	statement: Budget-to-actual comparisons must use the same accounting basis, classification, entity scope and period as the approved budget. Reconcile when the budget basis differs from the financial statements basis. Source: IPSAS 24 par. 31-32.
	ruleReferencedEntity BudgetLine
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty Amount
		ruleReferencedProperty ScenarioId
